# Terraform
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
**/.terraform/
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
terraform.tfvars

# Provider dependency lock files (.terraform.lock.hcl):
# - ROOT modules (environments/*, examples/*) MUST be committed for
#   reproducible, drift-free deployments across clients (see ADR-008).
# - Reusable child MODULES (modules/*) do not need a lock file: they are
#   never `terraform init`'ed/applied on their own in this repo, and the
#   lock is meaningless without a matching state. Ignore those only.
modules/**/.terraform.lock.hcl

# Sensitive variable files
*.auto.tfvars
!terraform.tfvars.example

# Environment files
.env
.env.*

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

